From: Jedidiah Oladele <66447747+jedidiah-oladele@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 19 May 2026 15:26:00 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 07/10] Allow voiding invoices (#21)

Finance needs to cancel invoices raised by mistake.

Adds `Invoice.void(reason)` and a new `"void"` status:

- Drafts can always be voided. Issued invoices can be voided only while
  no payment has been recorded; otherwise throw `InvoiceStateError`
  (they need a credit note instead). Paid and already-void invoices
  cannot be voided.
- A non-blank reason is required (`ValidationError`); it is stored
  trimmed and exposed as `voidReason`.
- A void invoice is final: it cannot be issued, edited or paid, and is
  never overdue.
---
